# Data Cleaning & Structural Validation

## Project Overview
This project transforms raw and unstructured data into a clean and reliable format for analysis.

The system handles:
- Duplicate entries
- Missing values
- Inconsistent date formats
- Structural validation

## Features
✔ Remove duplicate records  
✔ Handle missing values  
✔ Standardize date format  
✔ Validate data structure  
✔ Export cleaned dataset  

## Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas

## Folder Structure

data-cleaning-structural-validation/
│── data/
│   └── raw_data.csv
│
│── output/
│   └── cleaned_data.csv
│
│── src/
│   └── data_cleaning.py
│
│── README.md
│── requirements.txt

## Installation

Install required library:

pip install -r requirements.txt

## Run the Project

python src/data_cleaning.py

## Output
The cleaned dataset will be saved inside:

output/cleaned_data.csv

## Conclusion
This project ensures data accuracy, consistency, and reliability for better analysis and decision-making.
